{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f0917fba137b54912ad2bf0f746e32c3782bac57887389ca83f0d9f96504039", "ja": "（今日はこれから、次の定期公演のミーティングだ。\nちょうど新曲のデータも届いたし、これを持って……）", "zh": "（今天接下来要开下一场定期公演的会议。\n新歌的数据正好也送到了，带上这个……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1813595621245b8179fe1b02e5b3a204c0bc19efa28c6087bbe8142010ea8ffa", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "276894e0e19aeaa5ddc570a406e93ebeeb58744be90dcfbee280ab2b8e29272c", "ja": "{$P$}も、今からですか。\n……ナイスタイミング。", "zh": "{$P$}也是现在去吗？\n……真是好时机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c7b1da676b9fc75c169fde85ce0c78ad3bde87b625e518e732ba98d5ef43f48f", "ja": "瑞希、雪歩、お疲れさま。\nちょうど良かった、一緒に行こうか。", "zh": "瑞希、雪步，辛苦了。\n正好，一起走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1005_p", "source_sha256": "246a03edc5e6e87ddb6de391e33cffa1a338935444096165e7f0a3b50c8a52f0", "ja": "お疲れさま！\nお、全員そろってるみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n哦，看来大家都到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "296ca6fab8516c58aaf6541d27d700b60aca4bb223186ab637addaee0867cb18", "ja": "あ、やっと来た。\nもう、遅いよお兄ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，你终于来了。\n真是的，哥哥，你来得太晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "11d7a8b7bed0b5dd15f96b8b9753c53a68f29b493111173ae46739a2d7eab66f", "ja": "今日はミーティングだけなんだから、早く始めよう？\n志保さんも風花さんも、予定があって忙しいんだから。", "zh": "今天只是开个会，快点开始吧？\n志保姐和风花姐都有安排，很忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c6c7c33415494c0a7f0e56c496bb4ff6b448bbd58f10458228a0186c7d8ae395", "ja": "す、すまない……それじゃ、早速だけど\n次の定期公演のミーティングを始めようか。", "zh": "对、对不起……那就马上开始吧。\n先开下一场定期公演的会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cba4d647e5dca9d575236dcbaecbc3e1b0dda299ee79456ba7f38fcfb82bd77b", "ja": "今日は、出演メンバーの顔合わせと……桃子に\n新曲を歌ってもらう事になったから、その確認だな。", "zh": "今天是让出演成员互相认识一下……还有就是决定让桃子唱新歌，所以要确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "dbd7a92579e0b5339c6550a9ee4532884d86b1bb06737f377dd3a606440a894d", "ja": "ふふん、まかせてよ♪　それよりお兄ちゃん、\n桃子の曲って、もう届いた？　どんな感じ？", "zh": "哼哼，交给我吧♪　话说回来，哥哥，桃子的歌已经送来了吗？感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1011_p", "source_sha256": "373eebd542af5216202975f2f6ba621df149e2cc431bdc1b531a9a68a05e9bae", "ja": "ああ、さっきちょうど新曲のデータが届いたところだ。\nみんなにもちょっと聴いてもらおうかな。", "zh": "嗯，刚好新歌的数据送到了。\n要不要也让大家听一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "70a2096097b259996e340bc56b4cc3e409bbee16d5b3244ef5fe58fe7db7ca02", "ja": "本当！？　聞かせて！", "zh": "真的！？让我听听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "b2e19e3f82fe6e998ee58a7c5559db50ad91ef62a8cd3e0c5a6193bad035192b", "ja": "えっ……これが、桃子の新しい曲？\n……。", "zh": "咦……这就是桃子的新歌？\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9a89d1fe50ec7f49aef4f5fe78e750237d1ef1eb21381eb5cc14098bdbc97481", "ja": "わぁ……！\nこの曲、とってもカワイイですね！", "zh": "哇……！\n这首歌，真的好可爱呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "e082556151f665479b2c399ed3c6bd4cf8dac4bfc5dc5effde7e8805a8328b73", "ja": "はい。正に『アイドル』という感じがします。\nこの曲を周防さんが……きっと、カワイイぞ。", "zh": "是的。确实很有“偶像”的感觉。\n这首歌由周防小姐来唱……一定会很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4682101eb7eca355622d6135cfcfe6d7ec7ffb60c2d7a54bd8776dc62333866b", "ja": "桃子、どうしたんだ？　桃子にぴったりな曲を\n作ってもらったと思ったんだけど、気に入らないか？", "zh": "桃子，怎么了？我还以为让人创作了一首特别适合桃子的歌，你不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "f2aec9b2f3d309362e1439d20eb71a924014df57ea2d364057f7c5844b295e24", "ja": "別に、気に入らないとかじゃないよ。\nでも……なんだか、子どもっぽくない？", "zh": "也不是不喜欢。\n不过……总觉得有点孩子气，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e5b1d9b14ed420a160cb37e3d3001801bf49bb52cb2f60d8e1f8cadcecff90d3", "ja": "でも大人っぽい曲は、\nこの前ユニットでも歌ったばっかりだろ。", "zh": "不过，成熟风格的歌曲，前不久不是才和组合一起唱过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e9197d7b3affaf9019cf0eefef43d4a1f700db27ac3d251299cc8c1be890f66", "ja": "そうだけど、あれはユニットの曲でしょ。\nもっと志保さんみたいな、バラードとか……。", "zh": "虽然是这样，但那是组合的歌吧。\n我想唱唱像志保姐那样的，抒情歌之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1022_p", "source_sha256": "506b9a1c71157942c13781a1ef5d0a263241b8e2f3e22bd91205d6f49c1057c1", "ja": "バラードが歌いたかったのか？　ならまたの機会だな。\n今回は、この曲が桃子の新曲だ。よろしく頼む！", "zh": "你是想唱抒情歌吗？那就下次再找机会吧。\n这次，这首歌是桃子的全新曲目。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "8a095ebfde003184556c431ec1e1cc4dd0d964a1b0789fcffdf19cca767097b1", "ja": "は～い。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1024_p", "source_sha256": "f0c094c7a9763a81c5e09017588f1cc22a93b5df2bd3566f2f4a4b7498035b15", "ja": "レッスン予定はここに書いてあるとおりだ。\n特に質問がなければ、今日はこれで終わりにしよう。", "zh": "训练安排就按这里写的来。\n如果没有特别的问题，今天就到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0e02e29823b081dcec863c00ac6cafcac0b8219263bba73565d2a5ea4c23f325", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。私はこの後、\nレッスンが入っているので、行ってきますね。", "zh": "辛苦了。我接下来还有训练安排，先去训练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "e73fa1786719ab5ccc946bbba50a44ce8a88f4b4f86fd811d11914bef8158e77", "ja": "私は弟を迎えに行くので、今日はこれで帰ります。\nお疲れさまでした。", "zh": "我要去接弟弟，今天就先回去了。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1027_p", "source_sha256": "173d08f3fb93929ad9bd07f881e45c29f6e5dc2702dcbef5ca1923c6eecfd57d", "ja": "ああ。みんなも、お疲れさま。\n桃子も、今日はこれで終わりだったな。もう帰るか？", "zh": "啊，大家也辛苦了。\n桃子今天也到此为止了吧。要不要现在回去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "3c279abb5adf14a851e9e1134f7ed3a0a7a978e6111614ac4fda349996d43157", "ja": "あっ、えっと……。ねえ、お兄ちゃん。\n桃子、ここで宿題をやって帰ってもいい？", "zh": "啊，那个……哥哥。\n桃子可以在这里做完作业再回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "e29b8bd427b8b4443d5944f9f3aa052eccd73c3869f8ca7e86ac2a1b6c4941be", "ja": "な……なんか最近、家だと集中できなくて。\nでも図書館に行くには、時間が遅いし……。", "zh": "不……不知怎么的，最近在家里总是集中不了注意力。\n可是去图书馆的话，时间又太晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1030_p", "source_sha256": "953b07f17bc4daaf4a200cc97ad15134377892e31f965db2e80589bde12ae39a", "ja": "ああ。別に構わないけど……？", "zh": "啊，倒也没什么关系……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9b9675fa46b76d6bffb70065912de0377e02ce9aa6f6ee88377f8248c84a8d9c", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、宿題やっていくの？\nなら、私もやっていこうかなぁ。", "zh": "桃子，你要留下来写作业吗？\n那我也留下来一起写吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "2239c0f458d2b6d3401ccc74f49a262f4e764ad31757868bd3530e232ff9a180", "ja": "なんと。周防さん、萩原さん、私も混ぜてください。\nみんなでやれば、苦手な教科もサボらない。……はず。", "zh": "什么。周防同学、萩原同学，也请让我加入吧。  \n大家一起学习的话，就算是不擅长的科目也不会偷懒……应该。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "868e9759007a0c90cc4bbd5f17b2853f17796e678a3372d252198fa4a682bb70", "ja": "うん、いいよ。瑞希さん、苦手な教科とかあるんだね。\n勉強ならなんでも得意なのかと思ってた。", "zh": "嗯，好呀。原来瑞希也有不擅长的科目啊。\n我还以为你不管什么科目都很拿手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "f5f371f7ec8b07703c3858b241ca5afc58b33e4b29aac024ed73bdde6598c1e1", "ja": "そうですね。勉強は、嫌いではありませんが……\n努力をしても、上手くできないこともあるので。", "zh": "是啊。我不讨厌学习，只是……\n有些事情即使努力了，也还是做不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "0f64a5b86c305675ccdc088c37122ede9ad31664c4cc2b8448ffaa3815abb472", "ja": "ふーん、そっか……。", "zh": "哦——这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1036_p", "source_sha256": "cfc3bf82a644e773ed56fe8a84e313e76a1de6fb01a0c1df4cdc552463ef2db8", "ja": "桃子は、苦手な科目とかあるのか？", "zh": "桃子有没有不擅长的科目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "b75b9ba54ae6af817cc0fcc6d2cd66f73e9d24ac0c2c27dd4be5692d6e593a6a", "ja": "桃子は、算数がちょっと苦手かな。昔、お仕事で\n学校を休んだりしたから、たまにわからなくなる……。", "zh": "桃子有点不擅长算术。以前因为工作请过假，所以偶尔会有弄不懂的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "66ebda2b23640eb26089e5ee57a4b4d89109e60aec7225662f535e22d773f437", "ja": "なんと。私は、数字を覚えるのは得意なので。\nわからないところがあったら、聞いてください。", "zh": "哎呀。我很擅长记数字的。\n有不明白的地方，尽管来问我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "79862ab351138814b0578aa221ea36a5a01f787cf9765ff2a12b7915b7c1aa71", "ja": "本当？　ありがとう、瑞希さん！", "zh": "真的？谢谢你，瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1040_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "8dc853753442d48494e75a32e0cf5e6eb6d3ba6a74c6f023ecbbb7a701ad58e1", "ja": "えっと、分数同士は、10をかけてから割って……\nわかった、答えは1.5だね！", "zh": "那个，分数之间要先乘以10再除以……\n我明白了，答案是1.5吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "8e2da77e843c918534cac1d20ede4b6efb69ecbdca84e8baf38ebd750170df22", "ja": "周防さん、正解です。今の復習で、\nだいぶ覚えられたのではないでしょうか。", "zh": "周防同学，回答正确。经过刚才的复习，\n我想你应该已经掌握得差不多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "177d03edc21ad71d64038eda235171ada56af04311623f8f49264f84753fd1f2", "ja": "わぁ……瑞希ちゃん、教え方上手だね。\n私も、わからないところ教えてもらおうかな？", "zh": "哇……瑞希，你教得真好。\n我也请你教教我不明白的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "8df26d5e81daeed4dbec5a1fef68d533dc57510eec683ab5d9f106a3dee2d43f", "ja": "はい、いつでもどうぞ。", "zh": "好的，随时都可以来问我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1045_p", "source_sha256": "044e79557a123dc1ec6d38635833859e267631b1be9c1acaeebd3efb7c43ab7d", "ja": "宿題が捗って良かったな。あっ、もうこんな時間か。\n桃子、そろそろ帰らなくていいのか？", "zh": "作业进展顺利真是太好了。啊，不知不觉都这个时间了。\n桃子，差不多该回去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "5cfd28d1f4e1e4ff9ba707a2a0cf80673a4a5024d97d08f2d5c6cd6992187a4c", "ja": "あっ、本当だ！\n瑞希さん、雪歩さん、今日はありがとう！　またね！", "zh": "啊，真的呢！\n瑞希姐姐、雪步姐姐，今天谢谢你们！下次见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1048_p", "source_sha256": "6a45b41ac044c526ca896ce389e705b8ad7084daf5dcf1fd8ade540e396add70", "ja": "あっ、桃子……行っちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，桃子……走掉了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7dd665d878671c9b5237b42daf07068bd454b5569cd2575ee4f73213af719915", "ja": "{$P$}、あの……\n桃子ちゃん、ちょっと変じゃなかったですか……？", "zh": "{$P$}，那个……\n桃子是不是有点奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1050_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c8d9c3bd2c426693169210e41d03d66e8ebb7300b44ddf5781b68d0934c56b7", "ja": "わ、私の気のせいかもしれないんですけど。\nなんだか、無理にはしゃいでるみたいに見えて……。", "zh": "我、我也不确定是不是我的错觉。\n总觉得她看起来像是在勉强装得很兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1051_044miz", "source_sha256": "391c861930effdb07851c9f62d523096dbdfe1458bbcea20441497fd02175da0", "ja": "私も、すこし感じました。\n……周防さん、何か言いにくいことでもあるのかな。", "zh": "我也稍微感觉到了。\n……周防同学，是不是有什么难以启齿的事情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1052_p", "source_sha256": "5c21d1ec5a058cf5d99e24dcc6be28c735f657ee815c248a2f3f210880212dc4", "ja": "言いにくい事か……わかった。注意しておくよ。\nありがとう、ふたりとも。", "zh": "说起来为难的事吗……好，我明白了。我会多加注意的。\n谢谢你们俩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1054_041fuk", "source_sha256": "39bbd19e5de0d3b18b814f5ed351cfb3822addd2d4c1a605f4b5a27d7474e8b4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nあの、ちょっとお話、いいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n那个，能占用您一点时间聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1055_p", "source_sha256": "0e5befcb308dd27b981d35ce84d0a0505634565012351cd445ac435a09576ace", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花。ああ、大丈夫だけど。\n何か相談事か？", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。嗯，没问题。\n是有什么烦恼想商量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1056_041fuk", "source_sha256": "893772eb2208c9eedeb2bfa2195508c4707a8babb9a9da4394621ddfb4c47370", "ja": "はい。実はあの、桃子ちゃんのことなんですけど……\n近頃、いつも遅くまで残っているみたいなんです。", "zh": "是的。其实，是关于桃子……最近她好像总是待到很晚才走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1057_p", "source_sha256": "82803864178ac1d05e72c1df197c8d9bd2739b4ddaf0486a2656cd1fc72a1d9e", "ja": "えっ、いつも？　今日だけじゃなく？", "zh": "咦，总是这样？不只是今天？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1058_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1672392e59d46dd8fb4452e31c9b225fa96e1df3509621c772cea7a6c4d1f70f", "ja": "今日も残ってたんですね。\n私、なんだか気になっちゃって……。", "zh": "今天也留下来了啊。\n我总觉得有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1059_041fuk", "source_sha256": "83a17b8d65589dda9e8788c6efb9d76cdddbf6bd609210d905bf8173f0604a47", "ja": "昨日、「ずいぶん遅くまで残ってるんだね」って\n声を掛けたら、仕事だよって言ってたんですけど。", "zh": "昨天我问您\"怎么留到这么晚啊\"，您说是在工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1060_p", "source_sha256": "b801d874499fa263cab69520f2ae685ecc3a6e709b68d7c2c8a5b34d498c5e86", "ja": "仕事？　劇場公演はまだ先だし、\nそんな遅くまで残るような仕事なんて何も……。", "zh": "工作？剧场公演还早着呢，也没什么需要忙到这么晚的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1061_041fuk", "source_sha256": "09ef2289d86fbbfab1795eb620260a611f2094ea87c4d465ecc94ae83f67da18", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね。\nだから私も気になって……。", "zh": "果然是这样呢。所以我也有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1062_041fuk", "source_sha256": "246add39a705c0a75a50db6704dbb2295627c5dab4a76ef7387026564be9e615", "ja": "……昔、病院に勤めていたころも、なかなか\n家に帰りたがらない、小さい子がいたんです。", "zh": "……以前在医院工作的时候，也有过\n总是不太想回家的小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1064_041fuk", "source_sha256": "31b7f73b8a3d7769e77cd0c3f983ce373ed8e2faa66942b10c95e8fdf539c0cd", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……もしかしたら、おうちで、\n何かあったんじゃないでしょうか。", "zh": "桃子……说不定是在家里，遇到了什么事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1065_p", "source_sha256": "9dfb854123bf706d1827767ef8088605e859ff34b78fa1be7793aec8d0d3df41", "ja": "そうだな。\n……教えてくれてありがとう、風花。", "zh": "是啊。\n……谢谢你告诉我，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1066_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f4ef73823a0ebf6fb1840d7ff465b5b04746c715faa417d4eabdf6cec333d0f", "ja": "いいえ。……あの、私にお手伝いできることが\nあったら、言ってくださいね。", "zh": "不。……那个，要是有我能帮上忙的地方，请告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1067_p", "source_sha256": "8f4a33795d77b5204d0f2c25cbaea4b47e9fee819d4eb2a49765abaa06bbc318", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！\nそうだな、相談させてもらうよ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！\n嗯，那到时候就来找你商量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_082_1068_p", "source_sha256": "27d2c88e6bea74f4424f0831dd4069319091029e27390b563e3b312f19bf50f7", "ja": "（桃子が家に帰りたがらない理由か……）", "zh": "（桃子不想回家的理由吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
